From 16850713c8953ea036edddb323b039cb8a731fa1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ball=C3=B3=20Gy=C3=B6rgy?= <ballogyor@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:57:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fixes for the panel applet in in-process mode

Use glib/gi18n-lib.h instead of glib/gi18n.h to ensure that translations
use proper gettext domain.

Also, don't use gtk_show_about_dialog(), because this will interfere with
other applets.
---
 plugins/acpi/acpi-plugin.c            | 2 +-
 plugins/i2c-proc/i2c-proc-plugin.c    | 2 +-
 plugins/i2c-sys/i2c-sys-plugin.c      | 2 +-
 plugins/i8k/i8k-plugin.c              | 2 +-
 plugins/ibm-acpi/ibm-acpi-plugin.c    | 2 +-
 plugins/nvidia/nvidia-plugin.c        | 2 +-
 plugins/omnibook/omnibook-plugin.c    | 2 +-
